{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"CLOSING — the fix landed on main two days ago; only the ticket close was outstanding.\n\nEVIDENCE THE WORK LANDED\n  * Gerrit change 1050 \"9f0b: unify by-path test module identity\" — status MERGED, with\n    LLM-Review +1 (rebar-review-bot) and Verified +1 (rebar-ci-bot). Both gates green.\n  * On main as commit 7e3c50242da94ec2f1757b794c66ce434dc92f6a, dated 2026-07-30 18:28:24 +0000.\n  * Reachability confirmed from this worktree before closing: `git merge-base --is-ancestor\n    7e3c50242d HEAD` succeeds, and the same holds against `origin/main`.\n\nWHY THIS SESSION IS CLOSING A TICKET IT DID NOT IMPLEMENT — recorded for transparency.\nThe ticket was claimed by session 4ca991d2-5a60-4bb5-8fa2-54b7258425a8 (harness\n`claude-code_2-1-220_agent`), which authored and landed the fix, then moved on to other work\nwithout closing it — its most recent commit is on an unrelated ticket. The ticket has sat\n`in_progress` with its change MERGED for two days.\n\nIt is a CHILD of epic e369 (Jira Server / Data Center support), so an open child blocks the epic\nfrom closing even though the work is complete and verified. Closing on the merged, twice-voted\nchange rather than leaving the epic blocked on bookkeeping. Nothing about the implementation is\nthis session's; the code is unchanged by this close, and `reopen` remains available if the\noriginal session disagrees.\n\nCLASS: preexisting — the defect (`_load_module` using `sys.modules.setdefault`, yielding two class\nobjects and order-dependent `isinstance` failures) was in the reconciler test helpers before epic\ne369 began, and was neither introduced nor regressed by this epic's work."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785619238813313001,"uuid":"c636416c-b3d4-4b04-846a-5280c9540851"}